mindmap
  root((Requirements))
    Functional
      Core search
        Keyword query to ranked results
        Pagination
        Boolean and phrase operators
        Result snippets
      Query assistance
        Autocomplete
        Spelling correction
        Related searches
      Verticals
        Images
        News
        Video
        Local
      Freshness
        Breaking news within minutes
        Normal pages within days
      Webmaster controls
        robots.txt obeyed
        Canonical tags respected
        Removal requests honoured
    Non Functional
      Latency
        p50 under 100 ms
        p99 under 300 ms
      Availability
        Four nines or better
        Degrade never fail
      Scale
        Hundred billion documents
        Hundred thousand QPS
      Consistency
        Eventual for corpus
        Strong for control plane
      Cost
        Cost per query is the real constraint
      Privacy and Safety
        Data minimization
        Spam resistance
        Legal removals
    Out of Scope
      Ads and monetization
      Account systems
      Full knowledge graph construction
      Real time conversational answering
